Cyberpunk style: A luminous river of glowing data particles flowing through a dark industrial pipeline system, each particle transforming as it passes through distinct filter gates and transformation chambers. The stream begins as chaotic multicolored orbs at the source, then progressively becomes refined and uniform as it flows through crystalline membrane barriers that sort and reshape the particles. Neon blue and electric purple lighting illuminates the metallic pipeline infrastructure against a deep black void. Some particles dissolve at filter points while others morph and continue downstream, ultimately collecting into a sleek containment vessel at the terminus. The scene conveys elegant transformation and systematic refinement, with holographic readouts floating beside each processing stage showing abstract symbols. Steam and mist create atmospheric depth around the chrome machinery.
